#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:1
msgid "Shanghai Embodied AI Fund"
msgstr "上海具身智能基金"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:4
msgid "上海具身智能基金"
msgstr "上海具身智能基金"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:6
msgid "Investor | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "投资机构｜浦东新区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Hardware AI, Robotics, Sensors."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：AI硬件、机器人、传感器。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:10
msgid ""
"A state-backed embodied-intelligence investment route announced in April "
"2025, including core components and edge chips. Confirm the current "
"manager and investment mandate; no uniform cheque size or ownership "
"percentage is established here."
msgstr "2025年4月公布的国资具身智能投资渠道，涉及核心零部件和边缘芯片。需确认当前管理人及投资范围，不能推定统一投资金额或持股比例。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S046 "
"<https://www.gzw.sh.gov.cn/shgzw_zxzx_gqdt/20250422/0df6032bc73b4dbe9d363086336ca821.html>`_. "
"上海具身智能基金亮相，上海国投公司加速布局下一代人工智能战略高地_国企动态."
msgstr "`资料来源 S046 <https://www.gzw.sh.gov.cn/shgzw_zxzx_gqdt/20250422/0df6032bc73b4dbe9d363086336ca821.html>`_. 上海具身智能基金亮相，上海国投公司加速布局下一代人工智能战略高地_国企动态."

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:19
msgid "Funding mechanism: Equity investment."
msgstr "支持方式：股权投资。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://www.gzw.sh.gov.cn/shgzw_zxzx_gqdt/20250422/0df6032bc73b4dbe9d363086336ca821.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方资料及主管部门 <https://www.gzw.sh.gov.cn/shgzw_zxzx_gqdt/20250422/0df6032bc73b4dbe9d363086336ca821.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:26
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:28
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:30
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:33
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:35
msgid "Confirm the manager, sector, stage and legal-entity fit."
msgstr "确认基金管理人、投资领域、发展阶段及申请主体是否匹配。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit a deck, cap table, technology evidence, traction and financing "
"plan."
msgstr "提交路演材料、股权结构、技术验证结果、业务进展和融资计划。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:39
msgid "Complete commercial, financial, technical and legal due diligence."
msgstr "配合完成商业、财务、技术及法律尽职调查。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:41
msgid ""
"Review term sheet, investment committee conditions and definitive "
"agreements."
msgstr "审阅投资条款清单、投委会审议条件及正式协议。"

